OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA risk of patchy rain early for
OL,6,FOrkney at first and a few showers for
OL,7,FShetland. Otherwise largely dry with
OL,8,Fsome sunny spells and just the odd
OL,9,Flight shower, cloudier for Shetland.
OL,10,FBreezy, fresh west or northwest winds
OL,11,Fat times.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSomewhat cloudy at first but
OL,14,Fmainly dry with just the odd light
OL,15,Fshower possible. Staying mostly dry
OL,16,Fovernight with some clear spells
OL,17,Fdeveloping. Fresh west to northwest
OL,18,Fwinds for Shetland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
