OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FBright or sunny spells with a
OL,6,Ffew showers around in the morning,
OL,7,Fbecoming largely dry through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Fresh westerly winds for
OL,9,FShetland at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FAn
OL,12,Funsettled and changeable period, often
OL,13,Fcloudy with the risk of rain or
OL,14,Fshowers, rain possibly heavy at times
